+  "takeaways": [
+    "Light path through the eye: Cornea → Aqueous humor → Pupil → Lens → Vitreous humor → Retina → Optic nerve → Brain",
+    "Rods (~120 million): Sensitive to low light; black-and-white vision; night vision."
+  ],
+  "sections": [
+    {
+      "id": "1-three-layers-of-the-eyeball",
+      "heading": "1. Three Layers of the Eyeball",
