+    },
+    {
+      "question": "Q2. What is the function of the iris?",
+      "answer": "The iris controls the size of the pupil, regulating how much light enters the eye."
+    },
+    {
+      "question": "Q3. What are rods and cones?",
+      "answer": "Rods detect dim light (black-and-white); cones detect color and detail in bright light."
+    },
+    {
+      "question": "Q4. Where is the blind spot?",
+      "answer": "At the point where the optic nerve exits the retina — there are no photoreceptors there."
+    },
