+            "Keratinized stratified squamous epithelium (no blood vessels)",
+            "Keratinocytes, melanocytes, Langerhans cells, Merkel cells; stratified into strata (basale, spinosum, granulosum, licidum, corneum)"
+          ],
+          [
+            "Dermis",
